---

<section class="league-card">
    <h2>Get fucking ready for the IOWA CORN 350 on Sunday August 9th! Who's gonna get Bijan? We will start picking draft spots one by one according to our drivers finishing order after the race.</h2>

    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Manager</th>
                <th>NASCAR Driver</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>

        <tbody>
            {members.map(member => (
                <tr>
                    <td>{member.manager}</td>
                    <td>{member.driver}</td>
                </tr>
            ))}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</section>